204	<li><code>ActivateObjects</code> (Final Step 배치) → "8 object(s) activated, none changed afterwards" — PASS<ul><li>최초: <code>&quot;activated&quot;: true, &quot;checked&quot;: true, &quot;generated&quot;: true, &quot;objects_count&quot;: 8, &quot;failed_count&quot;: 0</code></li>
205	<li>Phase 6 수정 후 재활성화: 4개 object, <code>failed_count 0</code>, errors [] / warnings []</li>
206	<li>↳ does not prove: business logic is right; runtime behaviour with real data</li></ul></li>
207	<li><code>GetInactiveObjects</code> (program namespace) → "0 of this program's objects in a list of 3" — PASS<ul><li>목록의 다른 3개는 이 프로그램 소속이 아니에요 (ZSC4SAP_GS04O, ZSC4SAP_LOCKTEST_I, ZSC4SAP_LPS_RES).</li>
208	<li>↳ does not prove: objects are on the right transport</li></ul></li>
209	<li><code>GetUnitTestResult</code> → "no unit test run on this program recorded" — NOT RUN (필수 아님, Phase 5 skipped)<ul><li>↳ does not prove: cases the tests do not cover</li></ul></li></ul>
